<title>GERMANY: Adidas details 1996 Q3 sales, profit.</title>
<headline>Adidas details 1996 Q3 sales, profit.</headline>
<dateline>HERZOGENAURACH, Germany 1996-11-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Three months to September 30</p>
<p>(in millions of marks unless stated)</p>
<p>    Group net income per ordinary share  3.07    vs 2.65 marks</p>
<p>    Group net income			   140     vs 120</p>
<p>    Group pre-tax profit		     187     vs 143</p>
<p>    Group financial expenses		 3	 vs 17</p>
<p>    Group royalty and commission income  21	vs 23</p>
<p>    Group income from operations	   169     vs 136</p>
<p>    Group selling, administrative costs  398     vs 294</p>
<p>    Group gross profit			 583     vs 446</p>
<p>    Group sales				  1,472   vs 1,094</p>
<p>NOTE - Full name of the German sportswear maker is Adidas AG.</p>
<p>--Frankfurt Newsroom, +49 69 756525</p>
</text>
